   "lines": [
    "# Plants Vs Zombies",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG0\u0001",
    "",
    "### A Plants vs. Zombies style Windows tower-defense game in C++ with SFML: place plants, collect suns and stop zombie waves.",
    "",
    "Players place plants on a lawn to stop waves of zombies from reaching the",
    "house. Plants shoot automatically, sunflowers and falling suns supply the",
    "resources used to buy new plants, and zombies spawn on multiple rows with HP",
    "bars. The game runs on a classic loop of events, update and render,",
    "coordinated by PlantManager, ZombieManager, BulletManager, SunManager and a",
    "CollisionManager, with SFML handling graphics, audio, windowing and input.",
    "Controls are mouse-driven (click to collect suns, select and place plants,",
    "press Start in the menu). Ships as a Visual Studio solution for Windows with",
    "SFML runtime DLLs, plus an ASCII architecture diagram of the whole game",
    "loop.",
    "",
    "Built with C++ · SFML · OOP · STL · Visual Studio · MSVC",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG1\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG2\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG3\u0001",
    "",
    "\u0001IMG4\u0001",
    "",
    "[Visit](https://github.com/Usman-Khalil/PlantsVsZombies)",
